OL,3,GNEWSAA-level student starts her own
OL,4,Afashion line
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage model has launched her own
OL,7,Ffashion label while still studying for
OL,8,Fher A-levels.
OL,10,FGracie, 16, from Tavistock said she got
OL,11,Fthe idea of setting up her own clothing
OL,12,Fcompany while modelling on the catwalk
OL,13,Fat London Fashion Week.
OL,15,FBack home in her bedroom, she got to
OL,16,Fwork designing hoodies which she
OL,17,Fbelieves have a unique selling point.
OL,19,FThe teenage designer said the hoodies
OL,20,Fwere a single colour on the outside but
OL,21,Fhave a polka dot material lining the
OL,22,Fhood.
